{"meta":{"id":"runtime","category":"it/syntax/javascript/compile","title":"런타임 타입 검사 · strict 모드 · JS","subtitle":"(JAVASCRIPT)","summary":"typeof · instanceof · in 으로 실행 중 확인, use strict","tags":["javascript","f-runtime"],"color":"rose","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-rose","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-rose-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-rose-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-rose-50 text-rose-700 border border-rose-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></span>JAVASCRIPT</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">런타임 타입 검사 · strict 모드 · JS</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-rose-50/70 border border-rose-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-rose-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> typeof · instanceof · in 으로 실행 중 확인, use strict</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">런타임 타입 검사</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">typeof 10;              // &quot;number&quot;\r\ntypeof null;            // &quot;object&quot;  (주의)\r\nArray.isArray([]);      // true\r\nobj instanceof Date;    // 클래스 확인\r\n&quot;id&quot; in obj;            // 속성 확인\r\n\r\nfunction toNumber(x) {\r\n  if (typeof x !== &quot;number&quot;) throw new TypeError(&quot;숫자 아님&quot;);\r\n  return x;\r\n}</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">JS 는 컴파일 단계 타입 검사가 없으므로 필요한 곳에서 <strong>실행 중에</strong> 직접 확인한다</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">strict 모드</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">&quot;use strict&quot;;          // ES 모듈 · class 내부는 자동 적용\r\nx = 10;                // ReferenceError (선언 안 한 변수)\r\nObject.freeze(cfg).mode = &quot;x&quot;;   // TypeError</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › 컴파일 › 실행 시점에도 영향을 주는 문법</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/javascript/compile/runtime","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"javascript","title":"JAVASCRIPT","path":"it/syntax/javascript"},{"id":"compile","title":"실행","path":"it/syntax/javascript/compile"}],"hasImage":false}